00:59:37.711 --> 00:59:39.740
Near perfect subgame play,

00:59:39.741 --> 00:59:41.240
great use of blockers,

00:59:41.241 --> 00:59:44.165
different bet sizes using
different subgames.

00:59:44.166 --> 00:59:47.165
Weaknesses, well there's
no opponent exploitation,

00:59:47.166 --> 00:59:48.600
but that's by choice.

00:59:48.601 --> 00:59:49.860
In that, we wanted to make

00:59:49.861 --> 00:59:51.770
